sources:
    - id: samuelson1938
      title: A Note on the Pure Theory of Consumer's Behaviour
      authors: Paul A. Samuelson
      year: 1938
      finding: Consumer theory can be built on observed choices (what later became 'revealed preference') rather than on unobservable utility.

